-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- src:1603 | 22. —(1) Subject to paragraphs (2) and (3), an affidavit may be affirmed and signed in Singapore before, and the attestation completed and signed by, a commissioner for oaths with the deponent appearing before the commissioner for oaths through a live video link or live television link that is created using a remote communication technology that complies with the requirements set out in any practice directions for the time being issued by the Registrar. (2) For the purposes of this Rule, the deponent and the commissioner for oaths may sign the affidavit electronically in accordance with any requirements laid down in any practice directions for the time being issued by the Registrar.
@ref O 15 r 22(1) (src:1603)
GIVEN `it is done in Singapore before a commissioner for oaths with the deponent appearing through the link` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the link is created using a remote communication technology that complies with the requirements in the practice directions` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the commissioner can maintain visual contact and communicate with the deponent and any interpreter present throughout the process` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the commissioner can confirm the identity of the deponent and any interpreter present` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the commissioner can verify by visual inspection, read, interpret and explain the document to be affirmed and signed by the deponent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the commissioner can confirm that the document which the commissioner later signs is the same document affirmed and signed by the deponent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 15 r 22(1) the affidavit may be affirmed and signed, and the attestation completed and signed, through a live video link or live television link` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `it is done in Singapore before a commissioner for oaths with the deponent appearing through the link`) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "an affidavit may be affirmed and signed in Singapore before, and the attestation completed and signed by, a commissioner for oaths with the deponent appearing before the commissioner for oaths through a live video link or live television link"
        IF (NOT `the link is created using a remote communication technology that complies with the requirements in the practice directions`) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "that is created using a remote communication technology that complies with the requirements set out in any practice directions"
        IF (`o 15 r 22(3) the commissioner for oaths is able to do what the Rule requires` `it is done in Singapore before a commissioner for oaths with the deponent appearing through the link` `the commissioner can maintain visual contact and communicate with the deponent and any interpreter present throughout the process` `the commissioner can confirm the identity of the deponent and any interpreter present` `the commissioner can verify by visual inspection, read, interpret and explain the document to be affirmed and signed by the deponent` `the commissioner can confirm that the document which the commissioner later signs is the same document affirmed and signed by the deponent`) EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subject to paragraphs (2) and (3)" (the answer of paragraph (3) is followed: the commissioner for oaths cannot do what paragraph (3) requires)
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

